WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:48.990
Someone once said:

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:53.090
There is a thick forest where sap, sweet 
as honey, seeps out of the trees...

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:56.090
The Honey Forest!

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:00.670
Put their four petals together, 
and you make a tasty burger...

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:04.100
The Four-Leaf Clovurger!

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:11.480
Enticing the Butterfry, a frenchfry 
butterfly that smells like butter,

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:15.110
they create a natural burger set!

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:17.450
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:21.490
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:27.860
The legendary wolf, Battle Wolf, gave 
birth to a cub in the Gourmet Coliseum.

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:31.300
Then, its life was taken from it 
by a GT Robot which sneaked inside.

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:35.970
At the end of a fierce battle, a 
furious Toriko defeated the GT Robot.

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:43.110
Toriko gave the name "Terry Cloth" 
to the orphaned Battle Wolf cub.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:48.350
Just as Toriko and company were about 
to go capture the Regal Mammoth,

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:52.280
they got word that Sunny 
has already captured one.

00:02:55.120 --> 00:03:00.020
The Man Who Has an Invincible 
Domain! His Name is Sunny!

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:09.970
This Drunken Cow is great!

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:13.440
The flavors of the meat juice 
and tequila explode in my mouth!

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:16.710
<i>This</i> is what they mean when they 
say "drunk on this flavor"!

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:18.710
Let me eat some!

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:20.140
I ain't givin' you any, you drunkard!

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:22.810
They didn't have to bring the food outside...

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:26.680
Toriko-san has had his fill of Chief 
Mansom's Full Course since last night,

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.120
and they've entered the third round!

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.390
Toriko-san, how do you feel 
about the taste of Drunken Cow,

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:32.720
your 3rd time with the Meat Course?

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:35.590
Stop asking Toriko personal questions!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:37.160
And why are you here, anyway?

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:39.660
Chief Mansom gave me permission to film!

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:43.670
I'm gonna film Toriko and that rare 
ingredient, the Regal Mammoth!

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:46.200
What is with these people?

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.840
Anyway, Sunny sure is taking his time.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:51.010
I wonder if he's really 
got a Mammoth with him?

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:52.180
Hey!

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.180
He's here!

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:16.970
Huge! Is that a Regal Mammoth?

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:18.970
So praised as a source of 
food since ancient times,

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:21.140
it's even been called a "food treasure".

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.010
Its size is incredible, I see.

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:27.250
The just too amazing Regal Mammoth... 
This is one super-sized scoop!

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:31.620
Wait... That man is holding such 
a super-sized thing with one hand?

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:34.120
No, not just with one hand.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:37.590
Anyway, that size is...

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:44.230
That's...

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:48.900
Gang Hood (Reptilian Beast) Capture Level 15

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:46.230
It's a pack of Gang Hoods!

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:49.000
They're violent and have a huge appetite!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.040
They're going to try and 
steal the Regal Mammoth!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.300
What in the world will happen next?!

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:55.240
There's no need to worry.

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:13.020
Knocking?

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:16.260
But, he never touched them... 
How in the world...?

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.980
Ah, I'm sorry. Was that a tad heavy?

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:33.110
But, nice catch, Chief!

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:37.350
You look as strong as 
ever, but you lack beauty!

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:41.190
When you went to catch it, my 
chest didn't feel a pang at all!

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.220
It's like there was no feeling to it,

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:45.960
and you were bowlegged, 
unrefined, and totally unsexy!

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:48.160
It's like "just get outta my sight".

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:50.730
What's with this guy?!

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:54.800
Hey, Sunny! Don't go tossing 
such a precious ingredient!

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.770
This man is one of the Four 
Heavenly Kings, Sunny?

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:05.110
I would hope you are grateful for me 
carrying it so tenderly all this way.

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:08.680
My, it has been a while, Toriko.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:11.450
Your cells are more active 
than they used to be.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:13.550
Your skin is more resilient as well...

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:15.720
That's proof you've been eating well.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:19.290
Don't go touching my skin right off 
the bat like that. Creeps me out.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:23.060
Rin, what are with those 
huge lead-pipe legs?!

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:25.600
I don't see you for a while, and look 
at all that fat under your skin!

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:27.600
It's 'cause you only eat sweets like that!

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:29.900
It's healthy this way, I'm fine!

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:32.070
Not like you have a say in it, Brother!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:35.140
Not like I'd want to, with 
my manly little sister!

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:37.910
I don't wanna hear that from my 
big brother who looks like a girl!

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.910
Your voice is <i>so</i> annoying, you know that?!

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:42.680
And don't go touching Toriko like that!

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:45.380
So, the two of them are siblings...

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:49.120
You were talking about it earlier,

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:51.590
but he didn't actually touch anyone, did he?

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:52.420
No...

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:56.060
Actually, everyone was touched 
by his feelers... his Sensors.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.060
Sensors?

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.230
There's one left.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:01.800
Terry...

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:04.070
A Battle Wolf?

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:08.870
It's quite perceptive to notice my feelers. 
Quite reliable, if he were an ally.

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:12.810
No need to worry! He's 
Toriko's trusted Terry!

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:14.980
We were planning on taking him 
with us to get the job done.

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:16.950
The job of capturing a Regal-chan!

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:19.480
Wait, wait, wait... But I've 
already captured a Regal-chan...

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:21.950
I got a Regal Mammoth.

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:24.060
This is just a lost baby!

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:27.690
This thing should have parents 
way, way bigger around somewhere!

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:31.960
T-That's a kid?

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:38.170
Just how big is a fully grown one?!

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:41.740
We're gonna hurry and capture 
a grown Regal Mammoth!

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.980
Before the Gourmet Corp. does!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.240
Let's do this.

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:14.070
Butt Bug (Insectoid Beast) Capture Level < 1

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:18.280
Hold it! Let me eat your butt!

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:22.550
Your butt is really... sweet.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:28.750
Vice Chief Cook Starjun-sama!

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:35.030
Bei... Your choice in food 
is as terrible as ever.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.960
My, oh my... If it isn't the Vice Chief Cook.

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:41.200
It is quite rare to see 
you in the 6th Branch.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.900
How goes the Regal Mammoth?

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:48.010
We have sent 3 GT Robots 
to the No. 1 Biotope.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:49.110
Which members?

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:52.740
Yes... Mystery Man Zyper.

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:55.550
Gido.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:09:01.250
As well as Cedre-sama, 
Chairman of the 6th Branch.

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:05.190
I am afraid to say that Bei's GT Robot

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:09.260
was destroyed by one of the 
Four Heavenly Kings, Toriko.

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:10.560
Toriko...

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:12.600
Bei couldn't handle him, eh?

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:16.930
Joe Joe... I will go myself.

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:20.040
V-Vice Chief Cook, yourself?

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:30.880
Black Grass "Black Carpet" 
(Grass) Capture Level < 1

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:28.110
It's the Black Carpet, 
a field of black grass!

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:31.150
I've never seen such a 
vast Black Carpet before!

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:32.850
I'm an extra helping of impressed!

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:35.390
Turn it into a salad and you can't beat it.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:38.160
By the way, who are you?

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.790
Oh, sorry for not introducing myself earlier.

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:41.530
I'm...

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:45.200
Not like I care, but you are seriously 
lacking in the beauty department.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.400
Is that so? Sorry 'bout that.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:48.930
What the hell do you usually eat?

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:51.500
Usually? I eat normal stuff...

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.570
Normal? That won't do.

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:57.680
You need to eat foods with more vitamins 
and collagen... Something major!

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:00.680
I'll treat you to my Full Course some time.

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:04.280
Full Course?! What's your 
Full Course, Sunny-san?

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:07.720
Hors D'Oeuvre: Beautiful Skin Caviar.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.650
Beautiful Skin Caviar (Egg) Capture Level 30

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:10.120
Charisma Lobster Soup 
(Crustacean) Capture Level 19

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:10.150
Soup: Charisma Lobster Soup.

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:12.620
White Skin Tuna (Fish) Capture Level 25

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:12.690
Fish: White Skin Tuna.

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.660
Beautiful Beef (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 21

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.660
Meat: Beautiful Beef!

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:16.490
Baby Soft Sprouts (Natural 
Vegetable) Capture Level 15

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:16.560
Salad: Baby Soft Sprouts!

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:19.460
Charisma Dragon Scale Drink 
(Alcohol) Capture Level 35

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:19.700
Drink: Charisma Dragon Scale Drink!

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:23.370
I haven't decided on the 
Main or Dessert courses,

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:25.570
but they are all beautiful ingredients, yes?

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:28.870
Beautiful Skin Caviar, White 
Skin Tuna, Baby Soft Sprouts...

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:32.480
So many ingredients women who 
care about their skin would love!

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:36.010
We would expect nothing less from one 
of the Four Heavenly Kings, Sunny-san.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:38.520
She still changes completely 
in front of a camera!

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:41.890
Hey now. Sunny's got the weirdest diet 
of any of the Four Heavenly Kings.

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:43.520
I can't guarantee it'll taste any good!

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:44.690
Shut up, Toriko!

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:47.330
What about your Full Course then, huh?

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.630
I've only decided on the dessert.

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:52.200
What?! You've discovered more 
ingredients than all of us,

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.870
but can't make up your mind?

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:58.470
So... Are you still thinking about 
using <i>that</i> as your Main Course?

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:01.670
Toriko-san's Main Course?

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:04.580
Toriko! There's a Cocoa Mayo Tree here!

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:05.410
Really?

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:06.340
Ignored?

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:08.610
Cocoa Mayo Tree (Natural 
Food) Capture Level < 1

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:13.890
I give thanks for all this world's bounty.

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:17.320
The bitterness of the cocoa

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.760
and the sourness of the mayonnaise 
are delicately balanced...

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:22.760
It goes great with the 
crispy, chewy black grass!

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:23.860
Excellent work, Rin!

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:26.360
I was praised by Toriko!

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:28.970
And there's one more taste...

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:31.200
Maybe I'll use this.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.970
What is that?

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:37.380
That's a portable spicer 
I've never seen before.

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:40.680
Is that a Gourmet Spicer?

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:42.680
Yeah. If you want it, I'll give it to you.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:44.150
Are you sure?

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:48.420
You're the chef, right? Shouldn't 
you be the one to carry it?

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:50.190
Thank you very much!

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:54.390
Then with this, I'll make you a bunch 
of delicious dishes, Toriko-san!

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:55.290
Sure!

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:56.560
Yum!

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:58.630
Nothing beats the crispy black grass,

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:01.970
covered in Cocoa Mayo, sprinkled 
with crumbled Snack Walnuts!

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:05.170
Toriko-san, did you find 
this in Gourmet Town?

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:07.040
This is the latest model!

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:11.410
Huh? No idea. I found it laying 
around the Gourmet Research Lab.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.980
That's probably a prototype 
that's in testing.

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:15.880
Can you just take it like that?

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.150
And he just gave it away, too!

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:21.390
Terry?

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:25.390
Hey Terry, come have some! 
Eat together with me!

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:31.160
He's definitely wary of you.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:34.000
Pull back your feelers 
already. Aren't you tired?

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:38.270
Or are you surrounding us by your Sensors 
to be ready for the Gourmet Corp.?

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:39.500
Not particularly.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:44.510
So, another one like in the Coliseum 
will come in here, you think?

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:49.450
A GT Robot would be preferable. 
But our enemy isn't just them.

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:53.620
The IGO has 8 Biotopes around 
the world, the gardens,

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:56.450
each with its own climate and environment.

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:59.060
Each of them have their danger zones,

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:04.030
but this No. 1 Biotope is the largest 
and has the strongest beasts.

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:07.230
Danger A: The average capture level.

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:11.900
It's said the average level is 
27... Truly a hellish garden.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:13.600
According to the Chief,

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:17.280
that grown Regal Mammoth 
is in the Regal Highlands.

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:19.540
It has another name: The Devil's Den.

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:22.380
Yeah. We'll need to fight those Devils

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:25.020
if we want to get close to the Regal Mammoth.

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:27.690
But the Gourmet Corp. is in the same boat!

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:28.850
That's right!

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:32.220
They can't get to the Regal 
Mammoth so easily, either!

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:33.260
I suppose so.

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:37.960
Mostly. But if it were that one 
we met in the Cavern Lagoon,

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.160
it'd be another story.

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:45.070
Terry?

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:46.370
Toriko...

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:52.340
Those are...

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:10.730
Rock Drum (Crustacean Beast) Capture Level 27

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:09.960
W-What are those?

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.330
Rock Drums.

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:14.500
Their original habitat was the coast,

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.430
but in search of an even 
greater amount of food,

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:18.400
these beasts have evolved into land dwellers!

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:19.570
They're fearsome creatures

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:21.870
that cause devastating damage 
while hunting for prey!

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:24.280
Oh? You're well informed.

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.210
It's part of my job.

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:30.320
Although this is the first 
time I've actually seen one!

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:33.220
I-It's going to eat us!

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.020
Stand back, you people!

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:36.450
Sunny, back me up!

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:37.090
Don't want to.

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:38.020
Hey!

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.060
It's a pain.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.530
Whether it's a pain is 
neither here nor there.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:44.760
Frankly, they're not a creature 
I would choose to eat.

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:47.470
With the way they live, 
they've lost all beauty!

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:50.070
With the way they look, I have 
zero interest in fighting them!

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:53.070
But their meat is a delicacy! 
They're worth defeating!

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:54.510
Are they nutritious?

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:55.970
If not, then there's zero 
point in beating them.

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:57.410
Then let's split the 
difference and call it 50!

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:59.510
Toriko-san, they're coming!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.950
Five-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:15.590
Overdoing it at the Coliseum is 
taking its toll on my strength...

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:17.830
Doing any more multi-folds 
is gonna be tough...

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.030
And I can't use my left arm

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:21.500
after the damage I took in 
my battle with that GT Robot.

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:23.600
If only Sunny makes his move, then...

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:25.000
Toriko, behind you!

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:32.210
Terry!

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:35.450
I'm not gonna let you hog all 
of Toriko's smiles, Terry!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.720
Super Relaxation!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.790
Now, be calmed! You behave now!

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:44.360
Crap!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:46.690
That was Battle Fragrance!

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:49.790
Spraying BF will have the opposite 
effect and max out their rage!

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:51.660
Where'd my Super Relaxation go?

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.270
Rin-san!

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:04.540
Sunny!

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:25.500
Oh, sorry. Did I overdo it a bit?

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.070
Well, it dug its own grave.

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:30.770
It was quite beautiful when 
it was being blown away.

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:34.570
Bro, thanks so much! I'm so 
super-duper moved by you saving me!

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:37.610
The outer layer of their shell 
is a super scleroprotein,

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:39.480
attached to which is 
beautiful calcium carbonate

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:41.380
and beautiful carbonic acid.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.380
Huh, what's that?

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:44.080
The Rock Drum's shell.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.420
This is a perfect beauty stone!

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:48.850
Ingredients for Flawless Marble!

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:52.990
It will be reborn as beautiful 
tables and serving wares!

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:56.860
He cares more about rocks than his 
little sister! I can't believe it...

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:02.130
That's the one you blew away, Toriko-san!

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:06.640
The ingredients may be 10 yen pasta...

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:11.810
But when a chef places them 
on a beautiful platter,

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:13.650
their deliciousness becomes 
worth a small fortune!

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:18.920
Yes! The plate is a crucial supporter, 
drawing out the best in food!

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:21.650
With the help of a beautiful 
serving plate and presentation,

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.590
the rank of the taste of pasta will rise!

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:26.020
It is not just one's imagination!

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.260
It is truly a combined work!

00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:30.130
Beauty is harmony!

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:34.070
In other words, just aiming 
for taste is nonsense!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:36.300
The ultimate base of vulgarity!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.570
Understand, you people?

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.810
Wait, he was talking about us?

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:45.380
Now, here we meet again.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:48.310
Let us create harmony together, Rock Drum.

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:51.680
As a supporter that draws out my beauty,

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:54.350
you will once more be a creature of splendor.

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:56.620
Bro's gonna whip them out!

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:57.420
Stand back!

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:58.660
We're gonna get caught up in it!

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.030
Die beautifully!

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:02.930
Spatula!

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:10.570
So, how does it feel to 
be hit by your own punch?

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:16.870
About how far is the range, Sunny?

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:20.040
Good question. About 25 meters.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:24.020
Your Dining Kitchen's a lot 
bigger than it used to be.

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:28.520
Oh, yes... There was another one.

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:31.020
We gotta get farther away 
or we'll be caught up!

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:33.060
Caught up in what?

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:34.490
In Sunny's feelers!

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:35.360
Feelers?

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:37.960
Sunny's stretchable feelers...

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:40.200
His Sensors are stretched out everywhere.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:42.030
From the tips of his hair, see...

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:44.200
But, I can't see anything.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.640
Of course you can't!

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:47.870
They're 1000 times thinner than his hair.

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.510
Approximately 0.1 microns!

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:51.640
Wouldn't they snap easily being so thin?

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:56.480
They're totally strong! They can 
hold up 250 kilograms no problem!

00:18:56.750 --> 00:19:00.150
So although it looked like he was holding 
up that Regal Mammoth with one hand,

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:00.920
he was actually...

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:06.490
He was holding it with about 200,000 
tough strings, one for each hair.

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:07.990
And that's not all.

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:10.160
Bro's Sensors act like skin

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:14.300
and can sense heat, cold, 
pain, and of course, taste!

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:16.300
Entering Sunny's Sensor area

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:20.870
is like getting your whole body 
touched, and your skin licked.

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:28.310
It's sensed Sunny's Sensors by instinct...

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:34.490
Its own shell?

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:37.890
Hair Net!

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:42.730
Spatula!

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:44.560
He bounced it back!

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:49.530
W-What just happened?

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:52.300
Sunny's counter attack, the Spatula.

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:56.610
He can send any physical attack 
right back at his enemy.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:02.480
The range of my feelers is 25 meters...

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:03.780
And you're inside it.

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:05.320
Hair Lock!

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.850
It's stopped moving!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:11.060
I have to tie you up for preparation

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:14.760
before I break any more 
of your precious stone.

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:17.800
It was right to try and avoid 
a close quarters battle,

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:21.700
but he ended up entering 
Sunny's Dining Kitchen.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:23.570
D-Dining Kitchen?

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:25.940
It's over if you're caught 
by Sunny's feelers.

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:28.770
Even with the Rock Drum's 
power, escape is impossible.

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:36.310
The area in which Sunny can extend 
his feelers is his Dining Kitchen.

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:41.420
Inside it, all ingredients and 
prey are prepared and tasted.

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.790
Preparation complete!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:46.960
Life and death are once again in harmony.

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:48.760
This was a good encounter.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:53.360
Your existence has done excellently 
in making my beauty stand out.

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:59.400
Dining Kitchen... Also 
known as the Sunny Zone.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:03.810
Invincible. There's no one who 
could beat Sunny inside of it.

00:21:03.810 --> 00:21:07.980
Wow... So that's Sunny, one 
of the Four Heavenly Kings...

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:13.920
Little Regal-chan, I'll take you 
to the Laboratory right away!

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:17.490
My handsome cellphone.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:20.160
Oh, Johannes? What's wrong?

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:22.160
Chief! Gate C has been destroyed!

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:25.530
A new trespasser has invaded the garden!

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:43.050
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:49.320
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:56.560
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:22:01.500
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:22:02.770 --> 00:22:06.570
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:09.940
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:14.410
on a journey with no end!

00:22:16.280 --> 00:22:19.420
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:22.520
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:28.560
amid the waves of time.

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:33.600
Gourmet News!

00:22:34.600 --> 00:22:37.600
Good morning! I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:37.600 --> 00:22:41.840
The ingredient that Toriko 
captured today was the Rock Drum!

00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:44.410
It's famous for its shell, which 
can become high-priced marble,

00:22:44.410 --> 00:22:45.610
but its meat is a delicacy,

00:22:45.610 --> 00:22:47.310
and becomes a high quality drinking snack

00:22:47.310 --> 00:22:50.780
that even impresses the heavy drinking 
Chief of the Gourmet Laboratory, Mansom!

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:54.720
Among booze connoisseurs, it's 
known as drink's best friend!

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:57.490
Why not serve it with dad's evening drink?

00:22:58.790 --> 00:23:01.560
Man, I sure worked hard today...

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:04.430
And now, on to the next story...

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:09.330
Everyone's all split up! Where's Toriko?

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:13.300
With Rin!? I bet if I was with him, I could get a super-size scoop!

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:16.840
Regal Isle Dash! Search for the Jewel Meat!

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:19.370
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
